  "originalQuery": "You are troubleshooting a connection issue with a newly deployed Cloud SQL instance on Google Cloud. While investigating the Cloud SQL Proxy logs, you see the message Error 404: Not Found. What should you do?",
  "originalOptions": "A. Ensure that you are using an internal (private) IP address interface.<br/>B. Confirm that the instance connection name specified in your configuration is correct.<br/>C. Check if the Cloud SQL Admin API is enabled.<br/>D. Verify that your service account has the necessary IAM roles to connect to the Cloud SQL instance.",
