  "qid": "267",
  "tip": "<p>When you see an <i>error code</i> from the Cloud SQL Auth Proxy map it to the most likely layer. A 404 usually means the <i>instance connection name</i> is wrong so verify the exact project region and instance ID string before changing IAM or APIs.</p>",
